<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 Cor</para>
  <para style="toc1">eljwab eglewwel ala kuwrintuws</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Cor</para>
  <para style="toc3">1CO</para>
  <para style="mt1">eljwab eglewwel ala kuwrintuws</para>
  <para style="ip">elmuqedmeθ -elli yuri: emersal buwlus. -elli yemmeryasen: imumnen elkul elli g kuwrintuws. reγ elli eljwabe yemsemme eljwab iglewwel y imumnen g kuwrintuws, muc θah ewwel merre buwlus eyari y elkeniseθe. nessen wah εlexaTer yenne g eljwebes elli nette yuryasen elmerreθ qebl (5.9). w imumnen g kuwrintuws urinas zade (7.1). w lewse seg eljwabe δis ejaweb n buwlus f enceδensen. -f curintus: kuwrintuws netteθ ecciyreθ g eljenuwb n elyunan. w buwlus yebδe elxeδmtes δin g elmejmeε n iyhudiyyen, w elbeεεeδ yHewwel y eljneb n elHuc n eberrani elli yeδwel yθebbeε elmesiyH (eε 18.1-17). w elli θebεen elmesiyh elkul δ ifqiyren (1.26-29), emme ellan essisen elli δ imuγniyyen (11.18-21). elweqθ elli buwlus g kuwrintuws, yege elxiymeθ bac eyedder (4.12; 9.1-18; eε 18.3). -esbab n tires: buwlus yettelhe belgde s elmecakel n eljmeεεeθ n imumnen (1.10--4.21) w max i tteθεemalen d beεDhum (5.1--6.20). θih essentiyn δ elHajaθ elli yuri f elxeδrensneθ eljwabe, emme zade bac eyjaweb f enceδensen f aγa (7.1-40) d eče elli yetmewce y leSnam (8.1-13). buwlus yecejjeε δiysen f eεbaδ n erreb belgde (10.1--14.40) usinc eqtenεen elli erreb δ esenyuc enneSr f temettent (15.1-58).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="s">etteHiyyeθ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />seg buwlus elli ynebaθi erreb s elmeciyθes bac e ykuwn δ emersal n elmesiyH yesuwε, w seg ewmeθ suwsi <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />y elkeniyseθ n rebbi g kuwrintuws, elli yxeSSeSθen yqeddesθen y imenes s elmesiyH yesuwε, w yelli etneban s ellesm n elmesiyH g kul blase nette siδinsen d siδiθne. <verse eid="1CO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />fellawem enneεmeθ d eslam seg erreb deddeθne d yesuwε elmesiyH seyyedne.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />cexre g rebbi diyme fellewwem εlexaTer yuce δiywem enneεmeθ s elmesiyH yesuwε. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />εlexaTer zade s weθbeεewwem y nette teδwelem δ imuγniyyen g kul ciy, g edwi elli teqqeremti elkul d elmeεrfeθ elli tesnemteθ elkul. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />w xenyum ettemnem belgde s echaδeθ elli necheδ essis f elmesiyH <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />elmi θeδwlem mekumc neqSiyn Hette elmewHbeθ n erruwH w xenyum etrejam g esaδ n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />w elli nette δ exenyeHfeĎ θebtiyn belgde y ellexxer, bac e θbanem blac elεiyb g as n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />w rebbi eθθiyqeθ δ nette elli ynebeyawem bac e ykuwn γerwem ecarex d seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">ezuwni jar imumnen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />e yewmeθniyw eDelbe essiywem s ellesm n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH. eθkuwnem elkulkum δ imeθfehmen jmiyε, eltemzunemc emme elfekr iyjen d erray iyjen bac e θkuwnem δ imeθweHden belgde. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />w eljmeεεeθ n elεiyleθ n xelwe xebberni e yewmeθniyw elli jerawem elεerx. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />meεnahe kul iyjen essiywem yeqqar: "neč d buwlus." ziyγ "neč d ebulluws." ziyγ "neč d buTrus." ziyγ "neč d elmesiyH." <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />endre elmesiyH yemzuwn? endre δ buwlus elli yemmeSleb f elxeĎrewwem? endre θemγeTsem s ellesm n buwlus? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />e cexre rebbi elli elγeTse Hette iyjen essiywem kan δ kriysbi d γayis <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />bac e lyeqqar Hed θemγeTsem s elquwweθ n ellesmiyw. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />w γeTse zade elεiyleθ n eSTefan. b xlaf iyhen, ettesfekkerexc Hed xlaf γetsexθi. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />εlexaTer elmesiyH eyyuzinc δ γeTse, emme bac e becre s elbcareθ, w etεemlexc f elHekmeθ n edwi bac etmexsirc elquwweθ n temettent n elmesiyH f eSSeliyb.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />w elbcareθ n eSSeliyb γer elli helxiyn δ elbhameθ, emme γenne nečin elli nemneε δ elquδreθ n rebbi. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />εlexaTer yemmeri g elxθab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Is 29:14</char></note>: "δ ehelxe elHekmeθ n elli Hesben g imenensen γersen elHekmeθ, usinc ehelxe eδke n elli Hesben g imenensen γersen eδke". <verse eid="1CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />meni elli γers elHekmeθ? meni imuεellem n ecceriyεeθ? meni elli γers elfelsfeθ g elweqθe? εlexaTer erreb yege elHekmeθ g eddunyeθe δ ejjehl! <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />w erreb g elHekmeθes, yeqSeδ δ θesnen leεbaδ muc s elHekmtensen. emme yexs eymenneε elli emnen s ebeccer n injiyl elli Hesben δiys lebHaD δ elγbaweθ. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />uδayen Ďelben g elmuεjzeθ w iyyuneniyyen etHewmen elHekmeθ. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />emme nečin netbeccer s elmesiyH elli yemmeSleb f eSSeliyb. w wah ettγaγet n eεθer y uδayen, w δ elγbaweθ y iberreniyyin. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />emme y elli ynebaθen rebbi, δ uδayen ziyγ δ iyuneniyyen, nette δ elmesiyH elquwweθ d elHekmeθ n rebbi. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />w elli eyban δ elγbaweθ seg erreb, nette γers elHekmeθ exθer n leεbaδ. w elli eyban δ eDDeεf seg erreb nette eqwe n leεbaδ.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />esfekreθ ey ewmaθen max i θkanem elweqθ elli ynebeyawem rebbi. w elikenc jerawem egget γersen elHekmeθ, ziyγ δ imeqqaren ziyγ δ icriyfen. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />emme yexθar erreb elli emmeHsben δ ejjuhhal bac e yHeccem elli eHesben g imenensen γersen elHekmeθ, w elli Dεaf bac e yHeccem elli qwan. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />w yexθar imeθweDεen d elli emmeHqren w elli nihnin Hette ciy g elεalem, bac e yekkes elli Hesben δiys leεbaδ δ elHajeθ tebhe, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />w bac e lyetteθfuxar Hed ezzaθ n erreb. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />w xenyum tebεiyn y elmesiyH yesuwε s elfeDl n rebbi, w erreb yedjiθi δ elHekmeθenne. w s elmesiyH erreb exenyeHseb δ eSSullaH w δ imqedsen yefδeyane. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />w emmax i yeqqar elxθab: "elli yexs e yeθfuwxer, edj e yeθfuwxer s erreb."<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">eεlan n eslab n elmesiyH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />w neč, max i ddusiyγ, ey ewmaθen bac e xenbecre elγayeθ yeHrezθ w yuceyenexθi, ellesθeεmlexc edwi n enneHw ziyγ elHekmeθ. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />yemenni qerrere δ etwe kul ciy w neč jerawem, kan δ yesuwε elmesiyH d temettentes f eSSeliyb. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />w max i ddusiγ tweliwwem kane Dεiyf w xayef w δ emerεuwb egget. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />w max i kane δukkiγawem w etbecre δiywem, ellesθeεmlexc elHekmeθ d eqnaε, emme erruwH n erreb tessexen imenes s elqewθes. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />w weδiyn bac e ybed elimenewwem f elquwweθ n erreb, muc f elHekmeθ n elbecer.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />w reγm wah elkul, ndukke s elHekmeθ δ elbullaγ. emme elHekmeθe muc seg eddunyeθe, w la seg elquyyeδes elli fanyiyn. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />emme elHekmeθ n erreb elli θkan temmeHrez f leεbaδ, w yHeDDert erreb seg qebl n elbdu n eddunyeθ y elmejδenne. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />w etyessin Hed seg elquyyaδ n eddunyeθe, εlexaTer lukan esnenteθ elkenenc Sleben erreb n elmejδ. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />nečin nHekke f elHekmeθ yeqqar felles elxθab: "elHajaθ entezriyc TiT, w entesliyc θemedjiyθ, w etteseδc f elbal n elεebδ, w yHeDDert erreb y elli exsenti". <verse eid="1CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />emme yekcfenext y nečin s erruHes. εlexaTer erruwH n rebbi tessen kul ciy Hette δ elleγ n kul ciy n rebbi. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />δ wiyn isnen elli g erruwH n elεebδ kan δ elεebδ biyδe. w zade erruwH n erreb netteθ elli θessen efekker n erreb. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />w nečin enniwic erruwH n elεalem, emme erruwH elli seg erreb, bac e nessen elHajaθ elli yuceyenext rebbi blac. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />usinc enuθlay s edwi eθneqre seg erruwH elqudus, w muc seg elHekmeθ n leεbaδ. usinc enfesser elHajaθ n erruwH s edwi tesseqraθi erruwH. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />emme emmis n eddunyeθ, liqebbelc elHajaθ elli seg erruwH n erreb, εlexaTer yHesseb δiys δ elγbaweθ, w nette elyetgedc etyefhem, εlexaTer yelzem eykuwn δiys erruwH n erreb bac e tyefhem. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />emme elli δiys erruwH n erreb eyged eyeHkem g kul ciy, w eliHekkem δiys Hette Hed. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />(w elxθab yeqqar:) "εlexaTer elli yessen efekker n erreb edj e θyefhem." emme nečin γenne efekker n elmesiyH.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">elεebδ n erreb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />emme neč ey ewmaθen, elgeddexc exennuθlaye m elli γersen erruwH emme m idrari n eddunyeθ, m idrari g eliman s elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />w elli uciγewemt m elHliyb, muc m eče yeqwe. εlexaTer eltkenemc eθγeddem eθečem eče, w el ture xenyum etγeddemc. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />εlexaTerkum eltuciym seg iyh n eddunyeθ. w lukan δiywem eHsaδ d elεerx, etkunemc δ idrari n eddunyeθ w ettegem m leεbaδ iddiyn? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />εlexaTer max e yen iyjen: "neč d buwlus." "neč d ebulluws." eθkuwnem m elbaqi n leεbaδ. <verse eid="1CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />δ wiyn ebulluws? w δ wiyn buwlus? nihnin δ ixδiymen, essisen tefhemem eliman. w kul iyjen essisen yxeddem emmax i θiweSSe erreb. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />neč zreεe w ebulluws ysesw, emme erreb nette elli yedje elγers eyekbar. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />emmale ezzareε muc muhem, w elli yesseswe muc muhem, emme erreb nette elli yessekbar. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />w eHebbac e lferq jar elli yzerreε d elli yesseswe. w kul iyjen essisen δ eyawi ellejres elli eywate etteεbes. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />w nečin nteg jmiyε y elxeδmeθ n erreb, w xenyum ejiymi n erreb d elbniys. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />w s enneεmeθ n rebbi felle, neč egiyγ essas m muhendes δ emeqqar w elγiriyw ybenne felles. yelzem kul iyjen eyessen max δ yebne. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />εlexaTer elyetged Hette iyjen eyeg essas, bexlaf essas elli yegi rebbi, w nette yesuwε elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />w kul iyjen eyebne f essase wah elbni seg uwreγ ziyγ δ elfeTTeθ ziyγ δ elkurδ ziyγ seg elluH ziyγ δ elgec Hette seg eluwm. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />yemenni elli yebne δ θban elxeδmtes, εlexaTer as n elmesiyH e ybiyyen el Hajeθ elli yebne essis eθeqqim ziγ la. w elεefyeθ g esses ettekcef, usinc e θbeyyen elqiymeθ n elxeδmeθ n kul iyjen. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />iδekan eθeqqiym elxeδmtes elli yebnet f essas, eyawi ellejr. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />yemenni iδekan eθeHreq elxeδmtes, eyexser ellejr. nette biyδe eyemneε, emme eykuwn m elli eyemneε seg elεefyeθ. <verse eid="1CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />xenyum tessenem elli kul iyjen essiywem δ elheykel n erreb w elli erruwH n erreb δiywem. <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />iδekan iyjen eyexreb elheykel n erreb, eθyehlex. εlexaTer elheykel n erreb δ imqeddes, w nette δ xenyum.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Hette iyjen essiywem elixeddeε imenes. iδekan yelle δ wiyn yHesseb g imenes γers elHekmeθ n eddunyeθ, yelzem eykuwn δ imseTTek bac e θeδwel γers elHekmeθ b elHeq. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />εlexaTer elli Hesben δiys idrari n eddunyeθ δ elHekmeθ, nette δ elγbaweθ γer erreb. w elxθab yeqqar: "erreb yessendar g elli γersen elHekmeθ s elHekmtensen." <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />w yeqqar zade: "erreb yessen lefkar n elli γersen elHekmeθ, w yessen elli δ tettafehθ". <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />heδakeεlac yelzem elyetteθfuxar Hed s leεbaδ. εlexaTer kul ciy y xenyum: <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />siwe δ buwlus ziyγ δ ebulluws ziyγ δ buTrus, ziyγ δ eddunyeθ ziyγ δ eddar ziyγ δ temettent ziyγ δ elHaDer ziyγ δ elmusteqbel, elkul y xenyum. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />w xenyum tebεiyn y elmesiyH, w elmesiyH y rebbi.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">imersal n elmesiyH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />yelzem exenneHsben leεbaδ δ ixeddamen n elmesiyH w δ iwxiylen f lesrar n erreb. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />w elli eyemmeĎleb seg iwxiylen, yelzem emmefen δ eθθiyqeθ εerfinsen. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />emme neč, eyyethemc eyeθHesbem xenyum ziyγ δ timeHkemt n leεbaδ. neč zade etHesibexc imeniyw. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />ennefsiyw eyyetlumc f Hette ciy, wah muc meεnahe elli neč bhiyγ, emme erreb nette elli eyHaseb. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />emmale eθeHkmemc qebl as n eleHsab, qebl n elli edyes elmesiyH. nette δ ybiyyen elli yemmeHrez g eθsellesθ, usinc e ybiyyen elli g ulawen. elweqθes eyawi kul iyjen elli yelzem eyemmemdeH essis seg erreb.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />w neč ey ewmaθen, djiyγ imeniyw d ebulluws δ elmθel n elHeqe eθeθεelmem s γenne, usinc eθeθεelmem belgde w ettefγemc f elli yemmeri, w kul iyjen elyetteθfuxerc w elyetteθHezzebc g eDDed n elbaqi. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />δ wiyn i ximeyyez f elγirex? elli γerx elkul yuceyexθi erreb. w max i ttiwyeδ, ymat etteθfuxareδ emmax ettiwiyyec?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />etteθfuxarem elli xenyum tecbeεem tesθeγnam teδwlem δ lemluwk blac nečin! w yelitkum θkanem δ lemluwk b elHeq, w iδekan xenyum eθeδlem b elHeq δ lemluwk, e nemcarex jmiyε g elmelx! <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />yeδhurli elli erreb yedjeyane nečin imersal g ellexxer m elli yemmeHkem fellasen s enγe, εlexaTer neδwel δ elmenDer y leεbaδ elkul g elεalem d elmlayxe. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />nečin δ imSetken f elxaĎer n elmesiyH, emme xenyum δ elεuqal g elmesiyH. nečin δ iDεiyfen, emme xenyum teqwam. xenyum temkermem, w nečin nemmeHqer. zeεme belHeq! <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />el ture, nečin netεane elaz d efaδ d elεre d eDDerb d elhemleθ. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />nteεεeb w nxeddem s ifesnenne bac e nawi ečenne. enemsub usinc e nbarex. enemmeDlem usinc e neθHemmel <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />enemsub usinc e nuθlay s esyaseθ. el asse, nečin m elfeDleθ n leεbaδ, w m elwsex n eddunyeθ.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />neč δukkiyγ sah muc bac e xenHecme emme bac e exennenSHe, xenyum m idreriyw elli exsexθen. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />yumken γerwem εecre elaf murced g ebriδ n elmesiyH, emme elγerwemc egget elweldiyn! εlexaTer δ neč elli iruγawem g eliman s elmesiyH yesuwε w δ neč beccerγawem s elbcareθ. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />heδakeεlac exenmelge e yθeθbεem. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />w wah eyendeγ esbeb elli yedjayi exennezne memmi eθθiyqeθ elli exsexθi tiymuwθawus. w nette exenifekker s essirθiyw g elmesiyH emmax i sseqriyγ δiys g elknayes elkul w g kul blase. <verse eid="1CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />ellan elli etεilekni ettesδexc heδakeεlac εebban s ennefxeθ. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />emme b qudret rebbi δ eddese tweliwwem qriyb, usinc enziyγ iyh elli γersen ennefxeθ, γersen elquwweθ ziyγ kan δ edwi. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />εlexaTer elmemlxeθ n erreb muc δ edwi emme δ elquwweθ. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />met i θexsem, exenddase s θeγriyθ ziyγ s exse d erruwH n elHnan?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">elfsaδ g elkeniyseθ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />sliyγ elli b elHeq γerwem ezne! ezne exyeb n elli γer iberreniyyin: eryaz essiywem yetεacar g liwec n daddes! <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />w reγm wah eltuciym θεebbam s ennefxeθ! yelzemkum eθkezmen egget, w eryaz elli yege wah e yemmekkes seg emmesewwem. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />w neč, reγm elli δ elγayeb fellawem s elbeδniyw, δ elHaDer iδwem s erruwH. w seg qebl Sedre elHukmiyw f elli yege wah m elli mujuwd b elHeq. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />w max eθemlemdem jmiyε s ellesm n seyyedne yesuwε, w neč iδwem s erruwH, w elquwweθ n seyyedne yesuwε g emmesenne, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />yelzem eyemmuc eryaze y ecciyĎan, bac e yemmekkes elbeδnes, bac e θemneε erruHes g as n seyyedne yesuwε.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />elyebHic eθeθfuxrem. xenyum tessenem elli elxmiyreθ δ temezyent eθsexmer elεjiyn elkul. <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />emmale beεδeθ fellawem elxmiyreθ teqδimt bac e θkuwnem m elεjiyn δ ejδiyδ. xenyum teδwelem m elεjiyn blac elxmiyreθ εlexaTer eεelluwc n elfiSHenne, yeεni elmesiyH, yemmeγres. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />emmale yelzem eneqqiym nferreH s elεiyδ, muc s eγrum δiys elxmiyreθ δ teqδimt, elxmiyreθ n eccer d elfsaδ, emme s elfĎiyr eddiyc elxmiyreθ, elfĎiyr n endafeθ d elHeq.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />max i xennurye g eljwebiyw elli ettemsesremc d elfussaδ, <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />elkenexc qeSδe g lecrar elkul g eddunyeθe, seg ezzunnay d iĎemmaεen d iγeccacen d elli εebδen leSnam, ziyγ yelzem eθefγem seg eddunyeθe elkul. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />yemenni qeSδe elli yelzem entetxeliĎemc iyh elli eqqaren nihnin δ imumnen w nihnin δ ezzunnay ziyγ δ iĎemmaεen ziyγ δ elli εebδen leSnam ziyγ δ enimmam ziyγ δ isukerjiyyen ziyγ δ essurraq. w elli m iyh eθečemc iδsen.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />w max i θexsem eHekme g elli muc δ imumnen? emme elli δ imumnen yelzem enteHkmem xenyum. <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />εlexaTer elli elberre n elkeniyseθ δ entyeHkem erreb, w xenyum beεδeθ seg jerawem elfussaδ.<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">ecθxe jer imumnen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />iδekan iyjen essiywem yexs e yecθxe s iyjen seg ewmaθen, endre eyged e yecθxe γer elli muc δ imumnen g elεuwD n elli e yemreq y imumnen? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />eltessinemc elli imumnen δ Hekmen elεalem elkul? iδekankum δ θeHkmem elεalem, emmale eθgeddem θeHkmem elmecakel θimezyanin. <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />w xenyum tessenem elli nečin δ neHkem elmlayxe, emmale max enHekkemc elmecakel n eddunyeθe. <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />w iδekan ellan elmecakel jerawem f eddunyeθe, endre ettucem y elHukkam elli ettesθeεrifc essisen elkeniyseθ? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />melle δ elfDiyHeθ! endre eHebbac jerawem δ wiyn γers elHekmeθ eyged eyeHkem jar ewmaθen? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />endre eyged e yecθxe ewmeθ s ewmeθes γer elli muc δ imumnen? <verse eid="1CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />emmale iδekan yelle jerawem ecθxe, meεnahe elli xenyum xasriyn dime. εlac etteθHemlemc eDDulm? εlac eltqeblemc eθemmexδεem? muc wah xiyr? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />emme xenyum eθDelmem w eθxeδεem Hette δ ewmeθnewwem imumnen! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />xenyum tessenem elli eHebbac e lblaseθ y elli Ďelmen g elmemlxeθ n erreb. eθemmexδεemc. emmale, la δ elfussaq, la δ elli εebδen g leSnam, la δ ezzunnay, w la δ elli γersen elfsaδ, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />w la δ essurraq, la δ iĎemmaεen, la isukerjiyyen, la δ elli etsubben, w la δ elli selben, Hette iyjen seg iyh γers elblaseθ g elmelx n erreb. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />w yelle δ wiyn essiywem ykan g elHeleθe, emme erreb yTehrawem yerrewem y nette yqedsawem yeHsbawem δ eSSullaH s elquwweθ n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH d erruwH n errebbenne.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />kul ciy δ elHlal y neč, emme muc kul ciy yneffeε. w reγm elli kul ciy Hlal y neč, ettedjiγ Hette ciy eyyesθeεbeδ. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />eče y θeδisθ w θeδisθ y eče, emme erreb δ entyehlex essenniyn. w elbδen n elεebδ muc yezne emme y elxeδmeθ n elmesiyH, w elmesiyH nette elli e yettelhe s elbδen. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />w erreb elli yessikker elmesiyH seg θemettent, δ exenysikker nečin zade s elquδerθes. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />eltessinemc elli elbeδnewwem δ leĎraf n elmesiyH? endre egedde eδewye eTTerf seg leĎraf n elmesiyH usinc entHutte d temeTTuθ δ θelfasedt? musteHiyl! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />w xenyum tessenem elli ayeγ θelfasedt eyeδwel m netteθ. εlexaTer elxθab yeqqar: "essen eδuwlen elbδen iyjen." <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />emme elli eyeθbeθ d elmesiyH e yeδwel iyδes erruwH iyjen. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />erwleθ seg ezne! elγeldaθ elkul elli yθeg δisneθ elεebd elberre n elbeδnes, emme elli eyezne yeγleĎ g elHeq n elbeδnes. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />eltessinemc elli elbeδnewwem nette elheykel n erruwH elqudus elli yεemmer δiywem w elli yucewemti erreb? emmale xenyum muc δ elmelx y imenewwem emme y erreb. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />nette yesγeyawem yeδfeε essuwm, emmale mejδeθ erreb g elbeδnewwem.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">aγe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />w ture ejewbe f elHajaθ elli θecepem fellesneθ g eljewebewwem, xiyr y eryaz liθeγc. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />emme bac e neθjenneb ezne, edj y kul eryaz temeTTuθes w y kul temeTTuθ eryazes. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />w yelzem eryaz ayuc y temeTTuθes elHeqqes, w temeTTuθ zade aθuc y eryazes elHeqqes. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />w temeTTuθ leγrec elHukm f elbeδnes εlexaTer y eryazes. w eryaz zade. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />w elimenneε Hette iyjen essiywem wissen f imenes kan max e θemfehmem, w y elmuddeθ δ tuqSeyyerθ, bac e yezzal. w elbeεεeδ eθerjεem y eεeleqθewwem bac e lyetγurrec essiywem ecciyĎan max etteθHekkimemc g imenewwem. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />emme exennedje eθegem wah, muc δ ellemr. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />εlexaTer etteθmenniyγ ekuwnen leεbaδ elkul m neč. emme kul iyjen γers elmewHbeθ seg erreb, iyjen γers elmewHbeθe w wissen γers elmewhbeθ xlaf.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />w enne y elli elluγinc d ihejjalen eqqiymen m neč xiyr. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />emme iδekan elgeddenc eTfen imenensen yelzem eδaγen. εlexaTer aγe xiyr n elεδab n eccehweθ n elbδen. <verse eid="1CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />emme elli wγiyn entweSSiyγ w wah muc δ edwiyw neč, emme δ elli yseqre essis elmesiyH: yelzem ettedjiyc temeTTuθ eryazes. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />w iδekan ettedje δiys, yelzem eθeqqiym etteγc, welle eθsameH eryazes. w yelzem eryaz liθellefc y liweces. <verse eid="1CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />emme elbaqi elli elyeHkiyc elmesiyH fellasen, esennenne neč: iδekan iyjen γers liweces muc δ timuwment w θexs eθedder iyδes, esiθellefc. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />w iδekan icθ γers eryazes muc δ imuwmen w nette yexs eyedder iyδes, esettellefc. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />εlexaTer eryaz elli muc δ imuwmen e yeδwel yeqreb y rebbi f elxaĎer n liweces timuwment. w temeTTuθ elli muc δ timuwment e θeδwel teqreb y rebbi f elxaĎer n eryazes imuwmen. welle idrarinsen eleqribenc y rebbi, emme g elHqiyqeθ nihnin qerben. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />emme iδekan elli muc δ imuwmen yexs eyellef edj eyellef. elweqθes eykuwn elli muc δ imuwmen muc melzuwm s elεaheδ n aγe. w erreb yenneyane e nedder g esselm. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />εlexaTer δ wiyn iyessen yumken eθkuwneδ cem temeTTuθ timuwment esbeb n emneε n eryazem? w yumken eθkuwneδ cex ha eryaz imuwmen esbeb n emneε n liwecex?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />emme, eyeSSerref kul iyjen g eddunyeθ f elHesb n elmewHbeθ elli yuceyest elmesiyH, d elHal elli yHuTT δiys erreb. wah elli eθγeSbe f imumnen. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />elli yemnabe w nette δ imĎehher liHerrezc eĎehres. w elli yemnabe w nette muc δ imĎehher yetHewelc e yemĎehher. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />muc muhem δ imĎehher ziyγ la, elmuhem elxeδmeθ s elwSaye n erreb. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />yelzem kul iyjen eyeqqiym f elHal elli yHuTT δiys erreb. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />endre θkaneδ δ exδiym max i xinabe erreb? muc muhem. emme iδekan eθgeddeδ eθeδwleδ δ Hurri, eθDeyεec elfurSeθ. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />εlexaTer iδekanek exδiym max i xinabe elmesiyH, meεnahe θemneεeδ seg elquwweθ n eδδemb. emme iδekanek δ exδiym Hurri max i xinabe elmesiyH, teδweleδ δ y elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />yesγeyawem erreb s essuwm yeγle, eθeδewlemc δ ixδiymen y leεbaδ. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />kul iyjen essiywem ey ewmaθen, yelzem eyeqqiym d erreb g elHal elli yHuTT δiys.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />emme elli elluγinc, elγriyc y nihnin elwSeyyeθ seg elmesiyH. emme exennuce erray εlexaTer s enneεmeθ n rebbi teδwel γeri. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />enne, f elxaĎer n eDDiyqe, kul iyjen eyeqqiym f elHeles. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />endre cex merbuwT s temeTTuθ? eθeĎlbec e θebεδeδ felles. endre cex leγrexc temeTTuθ? eθeĎlbec temeTTuθ. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />emme iδekan tuγiyδ elteγliĎec. w iδekan tuγe θeqeyyerθ elteγliĎc. yemenni elli eδaγen e teεben g eddunyeθ, w neč elγisexc e θetεbem. <verse eid="1CO 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />ey ewmaθen exse enne elli elweqθ yeδwel δ iqSeyyer egget. emmale elli γersen elwacun ekuwnen ekenni blac elwacun. <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />w elli θerwen ekenni etterwenc. w elli ferHen ekenni elferHenc. w elli essaγen ekenni elmelxenc. <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />w elli etteθεemalen g lumuwr n eddunyeθ ekenni etteθεemilenc b elkul. εlexaTer eddunyeθe fenye s elli δiys elkul. <verse eid="1CO 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />exsγawem ettedjemc γerwem elqleq. elli elyuγic eyettelhe s lumuwr n elmesiyH, εlexaTer yexs eθireDDe. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />emme elli yuγe eyettelhe s lumuwr n eddunyeθ εlexaTer yexs eyreDDe liweces, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />w elhas yemzuwn f cirθiyn. w sahen temeTTuθ elli eltuγiyc ziyγ θeqeyyerθ eθettelhe s lumuwr n elmesiyH, w eθkun y nette s erruwH d elbδen. emme elli θuγe eθettelhe s lumuwr n eddunyeθ. εlexaTer texs esserDe eryazes. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />neč eqqare sah muc bac e xenneqne, emme g elmeSleHθewwem, bac e θegem ellazem texδmem elmesiyH belgde w s enniĎam yebhe.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />iδekan yelle δ wiyn yθeg g emuwHec y θexĎibθes w netteθ tekbar, w eccehweθes ettemeqqerθ, yelzem eyenjef. edj ayeg elli yexs, eddiyc elεiyb. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />emme elli eyfekker liθeγc w eθyeγSib Hed w nette cedd imenes, muc lazem ayeγ θexĎibθes xiyr. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />emmale elli ayeγ ayeg elHajeθ tebhe, emme elli liθeγc, xiyr.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />temeTTuθ temmeqqen g eryazes meδam yedder. emme max e yemmuwθ, γers elHeq aθeγ elli θexs, seg elli δ imumnen berk. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />emme yeδhurli eθkun ferHanyeθ exθer lukan eθeqqiym siyn. w yeδhurli egedde enne wah s erruwH n erreb.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">eδbayeH y leSnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />w ture exennenne f exsum elli yetmewce y leSnam, nečin nessen elli elkulne γenne elmeεrfeθ. w elmeεrfeθ ettetdje leεbaδ e εebban s ennefxeθ, w exse tbenne. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />w iδekan yelle iyjen yetεilak elli yessen elHajeθ, rahu elyessinc emmax yelzem eyessen. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />emme elli yexs rebbi, rebbi yessenti. <verse eid="1CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />emmale erjεe y exsum elli yetmewce y leSnam: nečin nessen elli leSnam elγersenc elqiymeθ g eddunyeθ w eHebbac e rreb kan δ rebbi. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />w iδekan telle g esme ziyγ g elqeεεeθ elHajeθ elli etteεlekenteθ leεbaδ δ erreb, w yelle essisen egget, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />emme yelle erreb iyjen deddeθne, nette elli yexleq kul ciy, w nečin nedder f elxeĎres. w seyyedne iyjen nette yesuwε elmesiyH elli essis kul ciy, w essis nedder. <verse eid="1CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />emme muc kul Hed yessen elHqiqeθe. ellan leεbaδ sθensen s leSnam el asse, w θetten g eδbayeH w etεilaken elli nihenti δegli n leSnam. w εlexaTer ennefsensen Dεiyf, eHussen elli emmenzsen. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />emme eče exenyetqerrebc y erreb. max e nteč, enneqqezc g ciy. w max aneč, enrennic g ciy. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />emme erreθ elbelewwem bac e tkunc elHurriyθewwem ettγaγet n eεθer y uDεiyf. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />iδekan iyjen ennefses Dεifyeθ exyezr cex elli γerx elmeεrfeθ, tqqiymeδ ettetteδ seg exsum elli yetmewce y leSnam, Hette nette eyeθcejjeε yeč seg eδbayeH n leSnam. <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />emmale eθkun elmeεrefθex cex esbeb n ehlax n uDεiyf, reγm elli nette yewwex w elmesiyH yemmuwθ f elxeĎres. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />w sah eθeγldem y ewmeθnewwem w eθyedzmem ennefsensen uDεiyf, xenyum θγeldem y elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />emmale iδekan eče eyessender yewwe, meεεač e θeče bac e tsendrexc yewwe.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">elHeq d elwajeb n emersel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />endre muc belHeq neč δ Hurri? endre muc belHeq neč δ emersal? w neč zriyγ seyyedne yesuwε, w xenyum elγelleθ n elxeδmtiyw y nette? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Hette elkenexc δ emersal y elγirewwem, neč δ emersal y xenyum. εlexaTer xenyum tebεiyn elmesiyH w wah δ chaδeθ elli neč δ emersal. <verse eid="1CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />wah erraw f elli etxeSamen diyyi: <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />endre elγennexc elHeq e nawi ečenne d eswenne seg elxeδmeθ? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />endre elγennexc elHeq eθemreq iδne temeTTuθ δ timuwment g esefrenne, emmax i θegen elbaqi n imersal d ewmaθen n elmesiyH d buTrus? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />ziyγ neč d berneba berk yelzemne e nexδem s ifesnenne bac e neč? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />δ wiyn yxeddem m εeskri f elHsebes nette? δ wiyn yzerreε g Tejnint w eliθeč seg elγeltes? δ wiyn yserreH g esεi w elisesc seg elHlibes? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />endre edwiyw wah δ edwi n leεbaδ ekehew, elteqqarc δiys ecceriyεeθ zade? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />w yuseδ g ettewrat n muwse: "eθlejmemc iymi n efuwnes w nette yeccacel." endre erreb ethemmenti ifunasen, <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />ziyγ yeqqar g wah f elxeĎrenne nečin? wa, wah yemmari f elxeĎrenne nečin, w elmeεntes: elli yxerrez yxerrez g elqeεεeθ, w elli yeccacel yeccacel g elHeb, w kul iyjen essisen yetraje eyawi elbeyes seg emjeres. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />w iδekan nezrεawem elberxaθ n erruwH, endre egget fellane max enemjer elberxaθ n eddunyeθ? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />w iδekan elγirenne γersen elHeq g elberxaθ n eddunyeθ entewyen essiywem, nečin ebjel, yemenni enneDlibc elHeqqenne, emme belεeks nečin neθHemmel kul ciy bac netεeTTelc ellenjiyl n elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />xenyum tessenem, elli xedmen g elheykel n erreb, tewyen g ečensen seg eδbayeH n elheykel. w elli xedmen f elmeδbeH n ewce, θewyen g elbeyensen seg elxiyraθ elli etmewcaneθ. <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />w sah zade elmesiyH yweSSe bac δ ewyen elli e tbecren s elbcareθ elbeyensen seg elxeδmeθ n elbcareθ. <verse eid="1CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />yemenni ellesθeεmle Hette elHeq seg leHquwqe. w elluriyexc wah bac e Ďalbe elHajeθ m tediyn. w efeĎle emmuwθe qebl n elli eyyeHrem Hed bac eθfuxre s wah. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />leγriyc elHeq e θfuxre s ebecriyw y elbcareθ, εlexaTer θah δ elHajeθ lazme, yeHliyli lukan etbecrexc s elbcareθ. <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />lukan θege g elxeδmeθe s elkifiyw, rahu γeri elHeq eDelbe ellejriyw. emme g elHqiyqeθ xedme muc s elkifiyw εlexaTer θege g elHajeθ yuceyit erreb. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />emmale mat nette ellejriyw f wah? ellejriyw elli e tbecre s ellinjiyl blac, w etĎelibexc s leHquqiyw m exeddam y ellinjiyl. <verse eid="1CO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />neč δ Hurri w muc δ exδiym n Hed, emme djiyγ imeniyw δ exδiym n elkul bac e rebHe y elmesiyH egget δ leεbaδ. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />bac e rebHe uδayen, δwele m uδay, w bac e rebHe eljmeεεeθ n ecceriyεeθ n muwse, δwele ekenni δ iyjen seg eljmaεeθ n ecceriyεeθ, reγmelli meniyc seg eljmaεeθ n ecceriyεeθ. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />w bac e rebHe elli lγersenc ecceriyεeθ, δwele m elli blac ecceriyεeθ, meniyc elberre n ecceriyεeθ n erreb εlexaTerni seddu ecceriyεeθ n elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />w bac e rebHe iDεiyfen, δwele m nihnin. δwele δ kul ciy y elkul bac e menεe lebHaD s elli egedde. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />w neč θege g wah f elxaĎer n elbcareθ, bac e ykuwn γeri elbay g elberxeθes. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />xenyum tessenem elli ettemsebaqen g θezle tezlen elkulhum, emme iyjen berk yrebbeH eljeyzeθ. emmale xenyum zade yelzem e θezlem terbHem. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />w kul imeθsabeq e yedderreb eSbiyH bac e yerbeH eljeyzeθ δ telfaniθ. yemenni nečin e nerbeH eljeyzeθ diyme. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />heδakeεlac neč θezle w γeri elγayeθ, w max elekme, etlekimexc m wiyn yečaθ g elhwe. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />yemenni eqehre elbeδniyw teεbexθi, bac e tkunexc seg elxussar beεεeδ elli becre elγiriyw.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">eεbaδ n leSnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />w exse e θesnem, ey ewmaθen, elli yejre y lejdadenne. elkulhum kanen eddu esHabeθ etgewweδ δiysen, w θεeddan g elbHer leHmer salmiyn. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />w elkulhum θεemden g esHabeθ w g elbHer bac δuwlen seg eljmeεεeθ n muwse. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />w elkulhum čiyn seg eče elli yuceyesenti erruwH n erebb, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />w eswiyn seg ecrab elli yuceyesenti erruwH n erreb, εlexaTer kanen sessen seg elHegfeθ yuceyesenteθ erreb w eθkan iyδsen, w netteθ δ elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />yemenni elmexθerensen elserDinc erreb, emmuwθen g eSSeHreθ. <verse eid="1CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />wah elkul yejreyasen bac exenikuwn δ edders, w ennettecθhiyc eccer m nihnin. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />eθeεbδemc leSnam m lebHaDensen, emmax i yeqqar elxθab: "yeqqiym ecceεb bac ayeč yesw, w elbeεεeδ yekker bac e yirar yberTeε." <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />w eθegemc ezne emmax i giyn lebHaDensen, emmuwθen essisen θlaθe w εicriyn elf g iyjen n as. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />w eθjerbemc elmesiyH emmax i giyn lebHaDensen, eldγentent tilefsiwiyn emmuθen. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />w eθbuHHemc emmax i giyn lebHaDensen, yehlexθen elmlax n temettent. <verse eid="1CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />wah elkul ySerasen bac e kuwnen δ edders, w yemmari y enδerenne nečin elli nedder g ellexxer n elweqθ. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />emmale elli yetkilak imenes δ eθθabet, eyer elbeles seg ewDe. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />elmHayen elli Sebentawem, δ elHajeθ Sayre y elbecer elkul. erreb eθθiyqeθ, exeniθuč elmHayen ekber n eTTeqθewwem, w yθučawem d elmHayen ebriδ d elquwweθ elli exentsufeγ essis, bac e θgeddem etteθHemlem.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />emmale ha leHbabiyw ebeεδeθ f eεbaδ n leSnam. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />neč δukkiγawem emmax δukkiyγ y elεuqqal, w xenyum eHkmeθ g elli eqqare δiys: <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />elkas n elberxeθ elli ncexr essis, nette ecarex d elli rebHen g elHajeθ s iδemmen n elmesiyH, w eγrum elli netkesser δiys, nette ecarex d elli rebHen g elHajeθ s elbδen n elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />w nečin elkul elbδen iyjen, εlexaTer teneεnuwyθ netteθ iyjen, w elkulne nettemcerax δiys. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />enziyθ elli θegen δiys bni israYiyl. elli θetten eδbayeH nihnin εebδen g erreb elli yetmeεbaδ g elmeδbeH. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />δ mat nette elmeεne n edwiyw? endre elmeεntes elli leSnam δ erreb δ eHeqqani, ziyγ eče elli yetmewce y leSnam nette δ eče δ eHeqqani? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />la, emme meεnethe elli eδbayeH n elli εebδen g leSnam nihenti δ eδbayeH y ecyaĎen w muc y erreb. w neč elγisexc eθkuwnem δ icriyxen n ecyaĎen. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />etgeddemc eθeswem seg elkas n elmesiyH d ecyaĎen jmiyε. ziyγ eθemcerxem g elmiyδeθ n elmesiyH d elmiyδeθ n ecyaĎen. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />w max aneg wah, enHeyyer elγirθes. w nečin nessen elli nečin menac eqwas. <verse eid="1CO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />kul ciy Hlal emme muc kul ciy yneffeε. kul ciy Hlal emme muc kul ciy ybenne. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />kul iyjen yelzem e yesεe y elxiyr n elγires muc y elxires nette berk. <verse eid="1CO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />kul ciy yetmenze g essuwq n exsum eθgeddeθ e θečeδ essis w elbalex δ imeθhenni. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />εlexaTer elxθab yeqqar: "elqeεεeθ d elli δiys elkul y erreb". <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />w iδekan ynebeyax iyjen muc δ imuwmen bac e θečeδ γers, w cex θexseδ e θemrqeδ, yelzem e θečeδ seg elli exyuc elkul, w elbalex δ imeθhenni. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />emme iδekan yennayex iyjen: "ečaye yemmuwc y leSnam.", eθečec essis f elxaĎer n elli yxebrex d erraHeθ n elbal, <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />muc elbalex cex emme elbal n elγirex, ymat yelzem eθmeqqen elHurriyθiyw s elbal n elγiriyw? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />w eče elHajeθ ecexre felles erreb, ymat eyluwmen f elHajeθ ecexre felles erreb?" <verse eid="1CO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />emmale max eθečem ziyγ eθeswem ziyγ eθegem la δ elHajeθ xlaf, egeθ kul ciy y elmejδ n rebbi. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />eθkunec δ esbeb n eεθar n Hette Hed, la δ uδayen w la δ iberreniyyen w la y elkeniyseθ n erreb. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />emme kuwneθ m neč, neč etHewale ereDDiyγ leεbaδ elkul g elli eθege elkul, w elettelhixc s elfeyδeθiyw emme s elfeyδeθ n leεbaδ elkul, bac e newlen elxlaS.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />eθbeεmi emmax neč θebεe g elmesiyH.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">eriyD n iyxef</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />cexre δiywem εlexaTer ettesfekkarem diyyi diyme, w ettesθeHfaDem f elεaδaθ elli uciγewemten. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />yemenni exsγawem eθesnem elli elmesiyH eyendeγ iyxef n iryazen elkul, w eryaz iyxef n temeTTuθes, w erreb iyxef n elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />w iδekan eryaz yetzelle w ixfes yemmiyreD, e ysender elqiymeθ n ixfes, elli nette δ elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />w kul temeTTuθ eθezzal teθnebbe w ixfes δ eεeryan, e θessender elqiymeθ n eryaz elli nette δ ixfes, emmax lukan ixfes δ imHejjem. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />w iδekan temeTTuθ eltγic e θiyreD ixfes, eθquS ezewes, emme iδekan δ elεar eθquS ezewes, yelzem e θiyreD ixfes. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />w eryaz meyelzemc e yireD ixfes εlexaTer eryaz m nette elmejδ n rebbi, emme temeTTuθ netteθ elmejδ n eryaz. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />εlexaTer muc eryaz seg temeTTuθ emme temeTTuθ seg eryaz. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />w eryaz elyemmexleqc y temeTTuθ, emme temeTTuθ temmexleq y eryaz. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />heδakeεlac yelzem e θiyreD temeTTuθ ixfes, δ ellemareθ n elli γers eSSulteθ w bac esnen elmleyxaθ. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />w εlexaTer nečin tebεiyn elmesiyH, temeTTuθ etsellemc g eryaz w eryaz yetsellemc g temeTTuθ. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />εlexaTer emmax temeTTuθ tuseδ seg eryaz, eryaz zade yθeseδ seg temeTTuθ. emme elkul seg erreb. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />eHkmeθ xenyum, endre e θged temeTTuθ eθezzal w ixfes δ eεeryan? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />w ettebiyεeθ biyδhe tesseHfĎawem elli ezaw iTwil δ elεiyb y eryaz. <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />emme yebhe y temeTTuθ. εlexaTer rebbi yucayes ezaw iTwiyl eθireD imenes <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />iδekan yelle iyjen yexs e yεareD, wah muc seg elεaδeθenne w la seg elεaδaθ n imumnen.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />emme beεεeδ wah, max neč θučγawem g elwSaye f ellejtimeεeθ, exenmedHexc εlexaTer ellejtimeεeθewwem etDurren exθer n elli nefεen. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />g ellewwel, yiweDi elli max eθemlemdem jmiyε, yelle jerawem ezuwni. w neč e tSedqe lebHeDes. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />w belHeq elεerx lazem, bac e yban imumnen eHeqqani δiywem. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />w xenyum max eθemlemdem jmiyε, elli ettettem δiys, nette muc δ eče n emensi n elmesiyH! <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />εlexaTer kul iyjen essiywem ayeč emensis elxaS seg qebl, usinc elluwzen lebHaD esxren lebHaD! <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />endre muc γerwem leHwac eθečem teswem δiysen? ziyγ θHeqrem g elkeniyseθ n erreb d iqelliylen? mat exennenne f wah, endre exennecxre? betbiyεe la! <verse eid="1CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />w neč uciγawem elli iwiyexθi seg erreb, w nette elli seyyedne yesuwε g iyD elli yemmezenz, yiwi eγruwm <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />yecxer ykesserθ yen: "wah elbeδniyw f elxeĎrewwem, egeθ wah bac e yθesfekrem". <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />w yiwi zade elkas beεεeδ emensi yen: "elkase δ elεehδ ejδiyδ s iδemniyw, kul merre eθeswem, egeθ sah bac e yθesfekrem". <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />emmale eledyas elmesiyH, kul merre eθečem δiys eγruwme teswem elkase, eθxebrem s θemettentes. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />w elli ayeč seg eγruwm n elmesiyH ziyγ eysu seg ecrebes w nette eθyetqedderc, eykuwn yeγleD εlexaTer elyucic elqiymeθ y elHeq n elbδen n elmesiyH d iδemnes. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />edj eyjerreb kul iyjen imenes w beεεeδ ayeč seg eγruwme yesw seg elkase. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />εlexaTer elli ayeč yesw menγiyr eyessen elli δ elbδen n elmesiyH, nette yeče yesw elεqubθes. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />heδakeεlac xθeren δiywem iDεiyfen d imuDan, emmuwθen lebHaDewwem. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />emme iδekan netjerreb g imenenne, rahu netteθjenneb g elHkum. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />emme erreb yHekkem fellane w yetrebbe δiyne bac e xenyetεeqibc d elbqiyyeθ n elεalem. <verse eid="1CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />emmale ey ewmaθen max eθemlemdem y emensi, rejaθ beεDkum. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />w iδekan iyjen essiywem yelluwz, yelzem ayeč g elHuwces, bac e xenyetεeqibc erreb f elemdewwem. emme elHajaθ tiddiyn max eddase ture e ntneDme.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">elmwaheb n erruwH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />w ture enuθlay f elmwaheb n erruwH εlexaTer elγisexc eθkuwnem δ ejjuhhal. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />tessenem elli max i θkanem tεebδem g leSnam, tkanem ettemgewweδem s leSnam elli eldukkanec. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />emmale exse exenfehme elli yδukke s erruwH n erreb nette liδukkiyc s eccer f yesuwε, w elyetged Hed e yecheδ elli yesuwε δ seyyedne kan s erruwH n elqudus. <verse eid="1CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />ellaneθ egget δ elmwaheb, emme erruwH elli ettučiyneθ netteθ biyδhe. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />elxeδmeθ δ lenwaε, emme seyyedne iyjen. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />w elεmayel δ lenwaε, emme erreb elli yθeg kul ciy g elkul nette iyjen. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />g kul iyjen erruwH eθbeyyen δiys y elxiyr n elkul. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />iyjen yθawi seg erruwH edwi n elHikmeθ, w wissen yθawi seg erruwH biδhe edwi n elmeεrfeθ, <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />w erruwH icθ aθuc eliman y iyjen w elmuhbeθ n eδawi y wissen, <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />w wissen e syuc elquwweθ y age n elmuεjzaθ, w wissen ennubuwweθ, w wissen emiyyez jar lerwaH. w wissen esyuc elquδreθ f edwi s elluγaθ ettimeθnewεin, w wissen eterjem n edwiye. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />wah elkul etteg δiys erruwH icθ biyδhe, w ettuč elmwaheb emmax i θexs y kul iyjen.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />emmax elbδen iyjen w γers egget δ leĎraf, siyn elmesiyH zade, reγm elli γers leĎraf egget emme nette iyjen. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />w nečin elkul uδayen ziyγ elli muc δ uδayen, d ixδiymen ziyγ δ iHurriyyen, nemγeTTes s erruwH iyjen bac e neδwel elbδen iyjen, w nerwe seg erruwH iyjen. <verse eid="1CO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />elbδen muc eTTerf iyjen emme leĎraf egget. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />w lukan ayen ekraε: "neč muc δ afus, emmale neč muc seg elbδen." endre e yeδwel b elHeq muc seg elbδen? <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />w max aθen temedjiyθ: "neč muc δ TiT, neč muc seg elbδen", endre e yeδwel b elHeq muc seg elbδen? <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />w lukan elbδen elkulle δ TiT, max δ nsel? w lukan elkulle δ temedjiyθ, max δ ncum? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />emme erreb yneĎĎem g elbδen kul eTTerf emmax i yexs. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />w lukan elkulle δ eTTerf iyjen, max δ eykuwn? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />yemenni leĎraf egget emme elbδen iyjen. <verse eid="1CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />emmale etgedc TiT aθen y ifessen "meHejtiyc essiywem", w yetgedc iyxef aθen y ikreεεen "meHejtiyc essiywem". <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />w belεeks elli eθnetteεlak eDεef Haje g elbδen, nette ehem Haje. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />w elli netteεlaki muc muhem, nettelhe essis belgde, w elli netteθHeccam essis, nettelhe essis exθer. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />emme elli netteθHeccimc essis, ettesθHeqc ellehweθe elkul. emme erreb yexleq elbδen yuc elqiymeθ y eTTerf elli elqiymeθes eqel, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />bac e lyetSarc g elbδen ezuwni, emme bac e ttelHan leĎraf s beεDhum. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />w max e yesθajeε eTTerf, e sθejεen iyδes leĎraf iddiyn, w max e yemkerrem eTTerf e sefrHen leĎraf iddiyn.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />xenyum elbδen n elmesiyH, w kul iyjen essiywem δ eTTerf δiys. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />w kul iyjen yHuTTi erreb g elblesθes g elkeniyseθ: imersal iglewlen, w lenbye eθθanyen, imuεelmen eθθelθen. w beεδensen elli θegen elmuεjzaθ, w beεεeδ elli γersen elmwaheb n ecfe, d ettelhe s iddiyn, ziyγ δ eδebber ziyγ d edwi s elluγaθ ettimeθnewεin. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />endre elkul δ imersal? elkul δ lenbye? elkul δ imuεelmen? elkul tegen elmuεjzaθ? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />w elkul γersen elmwaheb n ecfe? endre elkul dukken s elluγaθ ettimeθnewεin? endre elkul etterjmen? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />yemenni Hewmeθ bac eθewyem elmwaheb θibehhayin, w neč exensexne ebriδ ebehhay.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">exse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />lukan dukkiyγ s elluwγeθ n leεbaδ d elmlayxe, w elγriyc exse, ekuwne δ ennaguz yetren w δ enHas yečeryen. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />w lukan γeri elmuhbeθ n ennubuwweθ, w fehme lesrar elkul, w essene kul ciy, w γeri eliman eHewle essis edhari, emme leγriyc exse, yeεni neč Hette ciy. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />w lukan uciyγ elli γeri elkul y iqelliylen, uce elbeδniyw y eHreq, emme leγric exse, elrebHe ciy.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />exse ySebber w yebhe elyessinc elHseδ d etfuxiyr d eθkebber, <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />exse yetteθserrefc b ebhame, w yetHewwemc f elmeSleHθes, w yetteθγeccec fiseε, w yetfekkerc g eccer. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />exse elyferreHc s eccer, emme yferreH s elHeq. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />exse yetsemaH kul ciy, w yetSeddeq kul ciy, w yetteθmenne kul ciy, w yetteθHemmel kul ciy.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />exse yitqiyme diyme, emme ennubuwwaθ weqqaneθ w edwi s elluγaθ yweqqe w elmeεrfeθ tweqqe. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />εlexaTer elmeεrfeθ elli γenne δ tennaqeSθ, w eθnebbi elli γenne ennaqeS, <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />emme max edyes elli δ elkamel eyemreq elli δ ennaqeS. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />max i nkan δ ifrax, nkan nδukke w netfekker m idrari, emme ture neδwel δ iryazen, w nebεeδ f eSSerref n idrari. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />εlexaTer elli nzer δiys ture δ etteswiyreθ δ timδeγδecθ g temreyθ, emme esses δ θnezr uwδem y uwδem. ture elmeεrefθiyw δ tennaqeSθ, emme esses δ ettesne δ telkamelt emmax i yyessen erreb. <verse eid="1CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />emmale ture eliman d exse d erje eqqiymen diyme, emme ebehhay δiysen δ exse.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">ennubuwweθ w edwi s elluγaθ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />emmale yelzem e θkuwn γerwem exse, w exseθ eSbiyH zade elmwaheb n erruwH w exSuwSi elmuhbeθ n ennubuwweθ. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />max eyuθlay iyjen s elluwγeθ ettessinenc leεbaδ, eθfehmenc leεbaδ, εlexaTer s erruwH yδukke g elHajaθ, entessin kan δ erruwH. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />emme elli yetteθnebbe, yδukke y leεbaδ s elli yneffeε w yečejjeε w yetεezze. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />elli yδukke s elluγaθ ybenne y imenes, emme elli yetteθnebbe ybenne y meSleHθ n elkeniyseθ. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />exse elkulkum e θuθlayem s elluγaθ, emme e θeθnebbam ebjel, εlexaTer elli yetteθnebbe eεDem n elli yδukke s elluγaθ, kunc iδekan nette ziyγ iyjen xlaf yetfesser g mat i yeqqar elmi ettefhem elkeniyseθ, usinc e θawi essis elli ettiεezze.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />w ture iδekan useδγawem, ey ewmaθen, uθleyγawem s elluγaθ, max exennenfεe iδekan edwiyw eddiyc elweHy ziyγ δ elmeεrfeθ ziyγ δ ennubuwweθ ziyγ δ eseqri. <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />w Hette y elmeεεuwn n temuwsiqθ elli eddiyc eddar m elmezmar ziyγ elgitar, iδakan essufaγen eSSuwθ iyjen, max γ nessen δ mantan elmeεεuwn? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />w iδekan eSSuwθ n elbuwq δ imδiγδec, δ wiyn e yHeDDer imenes y elHerb? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />cex zade, iδekan eddukkiyδ s elluγaθ etmefhimnec, Hette iyjen elyessin elmeεne n elli teqqareδ diys. eθkuwneδ m wiyn yδukke y elhwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />g eddunyeθ elluγaθ ettimeθnewεin, emme eHebbac icθ leγrec elmeεne. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />iδekan eltefhimec elmeεne n elluwγeθ elli selle δiys, ekuwne δ eberrani y elli yδukke, w elli yδukke δ eberrani y neč. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />neč essene elli xenyum texsem elmwaheb n erruwH, eĎlbeθ erreb exenyerni essisneθ f elxaĎer n meSleHθ n elkeniyseθ.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />heδake εlac elli yδukke s elluwγeθ e yeĎleb seg erreb e syuc elmuhbeθ n eterjmes. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />εlexaTer iδekan etzelliγ s elluwγeθ, erruHiyw netteθ elli etzelle, emme elεeqliyw elyθeg ciy. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />mat age, emmale? ezzelle s erruHiyw d elεeqliyw zade. usinc e γenniγ ezzelle s erruHiyw d elεeqliyw zade. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />w iδekan tHemdeδ g erreb kan s erruwH, max i θexseδ elεebδ ayen "amiyn!" f eHmeδex, w nette δ jδid g eliman w elyessinc mat i θeqqareδ. <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />εlexaTer reγm elli eHmeδex yebhe, elγirex elyerbiyH ciy. <verse eid="1CO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />eHemde erreb εlexaTer δukkiyγ s elluγaθ xirewwem. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />emme g elkeniyseθ exse enne xemse δ elkelimaθ etmefhemneθ bac e seqriyγ elγiriyw, xiyr n elli enne εecre elaf kelimaθ s elluwγeθ etmefhimc.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />eθkunemc, ey ewmaθen, m idrari g efekrewwem. emme g eccer kuwneθ m ege n idrari w g efekker m elbullaγ. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />yenne elxθab, "δ eδuθlaye y ecceεbe s elluγaθ δ tiγriybin d ecwareb δ iγriyben, emme mehumc δ eyyeslen. <verse eid="1CO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />emmale edwi s elluγaθ δ elmuhbeθ y elli muc δ imumnen. emme ennubuwweθ δ elmuhbeθ y elli δ imumnen, muc y elli muc δ imumnen. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />w lukan emlemden imumnen uθlayen kul iyjen s elluwγaθ, usinc eδaδfen fellawem elli muc δ imumnen, endre ennen fellawem δ imehbal? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />emme max e bδan elkul etteθnebban, usinc e yaδef iyjen muc δ imuwmen, usinc e ysel elli e θwebbexen eHkemen fellas, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />usinc emmekcfen lesrar n ules, usinc e yesjeδ yeHmed y erreb, usinc e yecheδ elli erreb binetkum.<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />emmale, ey ewmaθen, max e θemlemdem w kul iyjen essiywem γers θeγunneyθ ziyγ δ eseqri ziyγ δ elweHy ziyγ δ edwi s elluwγeθ eltemmessenc ziyγ δ eterjmes, yelzem eykuwn kul ciy y eseqwi n elkeniyseθ. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />w iδekan yelle δ wiyn yexs e yuθlay s elluγaθ, edjeθ y sen ziyγ tlaθe b elkeθiyr, iyjen beεεeδ iyjen, w iyjen e yterjem. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />emme iδekan eHebbac elli e yterjem, elli yexs e yuθlay s elluγaθ yelzem e yessuwsem g elkeniyseθ, usinc e yehmes s edwi jares nette d erreb. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />w lenbye edj e yuθlay essisen sen ziyγ tlaθe, w edj iddiyn e Hekmen. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />w iδekan iyjen seg elli eqqiymen yuseδes elweHy, edj e yessuwsem elli ykan yδukke, <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />εlexaTer eθgeddem elkulkum eθeθnebbam, iyjen beεεeδ iyjen, bac e θεelmen elkul eθcejεen. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />w elli etteθnebban yelzem e θHekmen g ennubuwθensen elli γersen.<verse eid="1CO 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33-34" />εlexaTer erreb liγic elhemejiyyeθ, emme eslam. edj essusemneθ elwecunewwem g elkeniyseθ emmax g eljmeεεeθ n imumnen, meyelzemhumc eδuθleyneθ. w yelzem eslneθ emmax i θeqqar ecceriyεeθ. <verse eid="1CO 14:33-34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />w iδekan exsneθ e θεellemneθ elHajeθ edj enceδneθ iryezennesneθ g elHuwc, εlexaTer δ elεar e θuθlay temeTTuθ g elkeniyseθ. <verse eid="1CO 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />endre elkelimeθ n erreb tuseδ essiywem, welle tiweδ tweliwwem xenyum weHδawem?<verse eid="1CO 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />w iδekan iyjen yetεilak imenes δ enbi, welle γers elmuhbeθ n erruwH, yelzem eyessen elli uriγewemt nette δ elwSeyyeθ n erreb. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />w iδekan elyessinc wah, rebbi b elHeq eθyessinc. <verse eid="1CO 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />emmale ey ewmaθen, exseθ elmewHbeθ n ennubuwweθ w eθemnεemc edwi s elluγaθ. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />w edj kul ciy e ySar s enniDam.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">ekkar n elmesiyH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />w ture, ey ewmeθniyw, exse exennesfekre s ellinjiyl elli beccerγawem essis teqblemt teθbθem δiys, <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />εlexaTer e θemnεem essis, max e θeTfem g edwi elli beccerγawem essis, welle elimenewwem liSalleH y cey.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />neč iwiye wah w beεεeδ uciγewemt εlexaTer muhem egget: εlexaTer elmesiyH yemmuwθ f elxaĎer n eδnubenne, emmax i dyuse g elxθab. <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />yemmerδem yemsikker as eθθaleθ emmax i dyuse g elxθab. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />w beεεeδ yban y buTrus d etlemδe leθnac. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />w beεεeδ yban g elweqθ iyjen y exθer n xemse miyye waHed seg ewmaθen jmiyε, elmexθrensen elluciyn edderen w lebHaD yemmuwθen. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />w yban y yeεquwb w elbeεεeδ y imersal elkul. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />w g ellexxer yban y neč, ekenni δ englus yemmaru muc elweqθes! <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />w neč eqel waHed g imersal, w g elHeq ettesθHeqqexc emsemmiyγ emersal εlexaTer θεeddiyγ f elkeniyseθ n erreb. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />emme elli δiys neč ture seg enneεmeθ n erreb felle. w enneεmeθ elli yuceyit eltkanc δ elbaTel, emme jehδe exθer n imersal iddiyn elkul. emme δ wiyn elli yjaheδ g elHeq? endre δ nec? la, emme δ enneεmeθ n erreb elli δiyyi. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />siwe δ neč ziyγ δ nihnin, wah elli enbeccerawem essis w wah elli θemmenem essis.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">ekkar n inemmutte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />w iδekan netbeccer s elli elmesiyH yemsikker seg jar inemmutte, max ennen lebHaD essiywem elli inemmutte ettemsekrinc? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />iδekan inemmutte ettemsekrinc, meεnahe elli elmesiyH elyemsikkerc zade! <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />w iδekan elmesiyH elyemsikkerc, netbeccer s elbaTel w elimenewwem δ elbaTel. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />w enkuwn zade δ eccuhhaδ n ezzuwr f erreb, iδekan inemmutte ettemsekrinc. εlexaTer necheδ elli erreb yemsikker elmesiyH emme nette eθyessikkerc. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />iδekan inemmutte ettemsekrinc, elmesiyH elyemsikkerc zade. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />w iδekan elmesiyH elyemsikkerc, elimenewwem δ elbaTel w xenyum eltucim g eδnubewwem. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />w elli emmuwθen zade g elmesiyH, hlexen. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />w iδekan eθmenninne g elmesiyH yetteθεeddiyc eddunyeθe, nečin etεeb n elli emmexlqen elkul.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />emme elHqiyqeθ elli elmesiyH yemsikker seg jar inemmutte, w nette emenzu n elli emsikren seg temettent. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />temettent tuseδ f afus n elεebδ, w f afus n elεebδ edyes ekkar n inemmutte. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />w emmax leεbaδ elkul etmetten εlexaTer nihnin m adem, δ edren εlexaTer nihnin θbeθen g elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />emme kul iyjen s errutbθes: elmesiyH yekker g ellewwel, w max edyes elmesiyH elmerreθ xlaf, ekren elli tebεiyne. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />w elbeεεeδ ettas ellaxreθ, usinc e yerbeH elmesiyH elmemlxaθ elkul d essulTaθ elkul d elquwwaθ elkul elli ettimεaδiθ y erreb deddeθne, usinc e eyuc elmelx y erreb elli lennej. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />εlexaTer lazem e yeHkem elmesiyH usinc yHut leεδas elkul eddu ikreεnes. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />w exxer waHed g leεδe e yemmehlex nette δ temettent. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />w elxθab yeqqar elli erreb yedje kul ciy eddu ikreεnes. w max ayen kul ciy meεnahe yekkes kan δ erreb elli yedje kul ciy y elmesiyH. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />w max ayedj kul ciy y elmesiyH, elmesiyH biyδe yetĎaweε g erreb, elli yucayes kul ciy, bac e yeδwel kul ciy y elkul.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />w iδekan inemmutte ettemsekkirinc, mat elmeεntes elli θegen δiys elli etteθεemmeδen reγm elxTer n temettent? w imat etteθεemmeδen y nihnin? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />w y nečin zade, imat neTHut g imenenne g elxTer kul saεe? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />w neč medye g temettent kul yuwm, enne wah, ey ewmaθen, εlexaTer belHeq eθfuxre essiywem d imumnen elkul s elmesiyH yesuwε. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />meδemni δ elεebδ δ elfani, mat elfeyδeθ elli iwyext max i Harbe elhwayec g efesus? iδekan inemmitte ettemsekkirinc, emmale:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:32">edj aneč nesw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:32">εlexaTer eyče enemmuθ.<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />eθexδεemc imenewwem: elεecreθ temuHecθ eθfesseδ lexlaq ibehhayen. <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />eθSerfeθ s δkaweθ elbelewwem, w eθeγldemc, εlexaTer belHeq lebHaD essiywem ellessinenc erreb. wah exenyHuT g elHuθmeθ.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">ekkar n elbδen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />emme lebHaD essiywem enecδen: "max emsikren inemmitte? w s menten elbδen erejεen?" <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />ey ejjahel! elli ettezrεeδ linebbeθc kan max eθemmunkes eθqucrettes. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />w elli ettezrεeδ muc δ nette ennebθeθ elli eθembeθ, muc m elHebbeθ n irδen ziyγ δ elHabbeθ xlaf. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />w erreb e syeg elbδen emmax i yexs, w kul elHebbeθ γers elbeδnes elxaS. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />w elbδen n elHajaθ elli edderneθ elkul muc kifkif. leεbaδ γersen ennuε n elbδen, w elhwayec ennuε xlaf, w izenniwen ennuε xlaf, w elHuwθ ennuε xlaf. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />w ellan lebδan δ ismewiyyen, w lebδan δ iberriyyen. emme lebδan ismewiyyen ečebhenc y lebδan iberriyyen. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />w tefuθ γers ezzin, w teziyri γers ezzin xlaf, w kul iθri γers ezzin yečebbehc y wissen.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />w wah eyendeγ elHal g ekkar n inemmutte. elbδen elli eyemmerδem δ yefseδ emme e yekker meεεeč e yefseδ xlaS. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />eyemmerδem blac elkerameθ usinc e yekker s elmejδ. w eyemmerδem Dεiyf usinc e yekker yeqwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />eyemmerδem δ elbδen n elbecer usinc e yekker δ elbδen s erruwH. madem yelle elbδen n exsum, yelle zade elbδen n ekker s erruwH <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />w elxθab yeqqar: "ykan adem emexluwq emezwar δiys eddar." emme adem igluxxer, yeδwel δ erruwH tessedder. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />w erruwH muc δ iglewwel, emme exsum δ iglewwel, w erruwH beεδes. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />elεebδ iglewwel yuseδ seg ecal, emme eθθani yuseδ seg esme. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />w elli δ iberriyyen nihnin m elεebδ seg ecal, w elli δ ismewiyyen nihnin m elεebδ elli yuseδ seg esme. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />w emmax i ncebbeh y elli yuseδ seg ecal, e ncebbeh zade y elli yuseδ seg esme. <verse eid="1CO 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />exennenne, ey ewmaθen, elli exsum d iδemmen etgeddenc eδurθen elmemlxeθ n erreb, w la δ elfani e yureθ elli lifennic.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />erreθ elbelewwem, wah δ elHajeθ elli θemmeHrez exennettenne: ennetmettic elkulne, emme e nembeddel elkulne, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />g elleHDeθ ziyγ g elγemzeθ, max e ynabe elbuwq igluxxer w belHeq δ ynabe. elweqθes ekren inemmitte w elfennanc, w nečin e nembeddel. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />εlexaTer elfani yelzem eyembeddel y elHajeθ eltfennic, w wah elli e yemmuwθ e yembeddel y elHajeθ etmettic. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />w max e ySar wah, usinc e yembeddel elfani y elli lifennic, w elli yetmette y elli yetmettic, eySar edwi n elxθab:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:54">"temreq temettent, yaseδ enneSr!<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />ha temettent, exentγelbec! ha temettent, exentledγec!" <verse eid="1CO 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />w eldaγ n temettent nette δ eδδenb, w ecceriyεeθ netteθ elli θuce elquwweθ y eδδenb. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />emme elHemdulle elli yuceyane enneSr s seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />emmale, ey ewmeθniyw elli xsexθen, eθbθeθ bac exenyetHerrex Hed seg elbleSθewwem, kuwneθ diyme g elxeδmeθ n elmesiyH, w xenyum tessenem elli etteεbewwem f elxeĎres δ δyaγ elγeltes.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">eεawen n elkeniyseθ n urceliym</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />emme elemmeδ n eθberreε y imumnen, egeθ emmax i weSSiγ eljmeεεaθ n imumnen g γelaTiyye. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />kul iyjen essiywem e ylemmeδ elli eyeqδer fellas, kul as emezwar g elimeθ, w elyetkunc elmmeδ as n eseδiyw tweliwwem. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />w as elli eddase, δ azne elhδeyewwem y urceliym d elli ettexθarem xenyum, usinc esennuce eljwab n elwSeyeθiyw. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />w iδekan xiyr esefre neč usinc e sefren iyδi.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">elbernamej n esfar n buwlus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />w δ exenneddase beεεeδ elli eθεeddiγ f meqduwnye, εlexaTer δ eθεeddiγ fellas. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />balek e qqiyme γerwem liyyameθ w yumken e εeddiγ tejresθ elkul, bac e yeθεewnem g esefriyw meni emerqe. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />w ture neč elγisexc exennezre liyyameθ ettukSeyrin, emme exse e qqime iδwem elmuddeθ δ tiTwilt b qudret rebbi. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />emme ture δ erajiγ g efesus elelεiyδ n elxemsiyn, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />εlexaTer erreb ymiriδ δiys elbab δ emeqqar y neč y elxeδmeθ blac etεeb, reγm elli leεδe egget.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />iδekan yuseδ tiymuwθawus tweliwwem, efrHeθ essis, εlexaTer yxeddem erreb m neč. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />w eθiHeqqer Hed, emme εewnemti bac e yyerjeε lebas, εlexaTer neč d ewmaθen netraje δiys.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />emme ewmaθ ebbulluws, eĎlebe essis δ edyes tweliwwem nette d ewmaθen, emme lyeqqilc exendyas ture. w max ayef elfurSeθ exendyas.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">etteHiyyeθ d esslam xasiyn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />erreθ elbelewwem, eθbθeθ g eliman, jahδeθ teθqewwem m iryazen. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />egeθ kul ciy s exse. <verse eid="1CO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />ey ewmaθen, xenyum tessenem elεiyleθ n eSfehan. nihnin iglewlen elli emmenen s elmesiyH g axaYia, w edjiyn imenensen y elxeδmeθ n imumnen. heδakeεlac eDelbe essiywem <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />entĎewεem nihnin d elli xedmen iδsen. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />w freHe s aseδ n eSfehan d fertuwnatus d exaYikus, εlexaTer εewweDnawem g elγyebewwem, <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />reyHen uliyw emmax i reyHen ulewnewwem. emmale kermemten.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />imumnen elli g esye etselmen fellawem. w etselmen fellawem egget εqiyl d berke d imumnen elli ettemlemmaδen g elmesiyH g elHucensen. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />ewmaθen elkul elli δah etselmen fellawem, selmeθ f beεDkum s ekubbi δ eTTaher.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />eslame s elxeT n efusiyw neč buwlus. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />elli liγic elmesiyH, e yehlex. "maranata!", est ey errebbenne!. <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />enneεmeθ n elmesiyH iδwem. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />w exsew y xenyum elkul g elmesiyH yesuwε. emiyn!<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>